      <title>Moodlib 0.6.0</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 13:09:21 +0100</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>190</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.6.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>A short tour for first-time use. Find Lost References brings stray pictures into your library, grouped by folder in Graph. Smoother library and graph, gentler AI tagging, a tidier browser panel.</p>]]></description>
